/* the tier pick's label: the winners' score in a model career's first event, made with the ruleset a new career gets (M3: t9's skillAt, archetypes and the Home Open); the model career keeps out of a live career's caches (CAR_C is saved and restored around it) */
/* the tier-pick label: a fresh career's typical winning nine in its first season (Regional, National), measured from the model's own events: 60 career seeds × 4 nines a tier (stroke play, the Stableford's cards, the major's two nines), the mean of each nine's best card, per ruleset. base.html's label was one nine of one model career, which put either tier a stroke or three off its mean (t9 National read −3 against −2.5). The harness's m3accept group re-measures it */
