/* F-170 R6.1 the rota, drawn once (a new career, or a migrated career's first t9 season) and stored, so a later generator change cannot move a venue: per tier the five islands of t8Seeds' biome walk other than the home biome, seeded by thash(C.seed,0,881), and one Q-school island. R6.2 event 0 of every tier is the Home Open at your home island; events 1–5 are the tier's five, in the same order every season (R6.3: t8Cond still takes the routing and the conditions from the date) */
