/* F-169 R5 the rolling world ranking: all 72 places (the 71 house players on the three tours and you). An event gives the standings points it awarded (POINTS8, KO_POINTS or a pair's, BIG applied) × WR_W[its tier]; Q-school gives none. The window is this season and the last; the average is the total over max(events played, WR_MIN_DIV); a skipped or ineligible event is not played (no points, no divisor); ties go to more events, then the higher single event, then the lower id. C.wr = [{s, p:{id:[6]}}] (null: not played), written at each event's end; the season before last drops when a season writes. It gates nothing */
