  "{name}: '{ledger} and counting. See you at {next}.'","{name}: '{them} for me at {venue}, {me} for you. {ledger}, and I'm the one counting.'","{name}: 'I'll shout the drinks at {next}. Tradition now.'",
  "{name}: '{ledger} to you. One good run doesn't make it a rivalry.'","{name}: 'Enjoy {ledger}. {next} suits me.'","{name}: 'I've been practising. Ask me about the wind at {next}.'",
  "{name}: 'Just the two of us. Finally.'","{name}: 'Head to head. No field to hide behind, for either of us.'","{name}: 'Loser shouts the caddies. Winner gets the story.'",
  "{name}: 'Different tour, same ranking. I check yours every week.'","{name}: 'We'll meet again. The ranking says so.'","{name}: 'Two tours apart. {ledger} still stands.'",
